   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NGO Working Group on Women, Peace and Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NGO Working Group on Women, Peace and Security vill st&#xe4;rka kvinnors deltagande i fredsprocesser och fredsbyggande arbete samt f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra FN:s s&#xe4;kerhetsr&#xe5;dsarbete. 
Verksamheten str&#xe4;cker sig &#xf6;ver fyra aktiviteter:
1. Organisera och f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rka civilsamh&#xe4;llet.
2. Ta fram policyrekommendationer.
3. Policybevakning och analys av s&#xe4;kerhetsr&#xe5;dets arbete.
4. Opinionsbildning och utbildning av nya medlemmar i FN:s s&#xe4;kerhetsr&#xe5;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NGO Working Group on Women, Peace and Security wants to strengthen women&apos;s participation in peace processes and peacebuilding work and improve UN Security Council work.The activities covers four activities:1. Organize and strengthen civil society.2. Obtain policy recommendations.3. Policy monitoring and analysis of the Security Council&apos;s work.4. Opinion formation and training of new members of the UN Security Council.</narrative>
  </description>
